  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Firebase Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `firebase-integration-rpc` SKILL.md mandate, particularly the mandatory Firebase provisioning step. The initial step always requires calling `show_aistudio_`. I\'m starting to build out a mental map of the Firebase setup process and its implications for subsequent coding.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Firebase Setup**\n\nOkay, I\'ve re-read the Firebase integration instructions and confirmed: the very first step is to call `show_aistudio_ui` with `ui_type: \"firebase_setup\"` and immediately halt. I was tempted to jump ahead to Google Maps, but the prompt says to stop right after that UI call. This means I can postpone the Google Maps consideration for now and focus on Firebase first.\n\n\n"
