  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Image Qualities**\n\nThe image analysis is off to a solid start. I\'ve pinpointed three promising shop photos that really stand out \342\200\223 they\'re sharp, and capture an architectural and authentic feel. The returned file paths are as follows: `/src/assets/images/shop_campus_press_1795079810571.jpg`, `/src/assets/images/shop_metro_print_1795079813823.jpg`, and `/src/assets/images/shop_apex`. I\'m going to further analyze these for the next step.\n\n\n**Updating Foundation Files**\n\nI\'m now focused on systematically updating the project\'s foundation files. This includes critical updates to the `firebase-blueprint.json` following the `FirebaseBlueprintConfig` schema, ensuring `eslint.config.mjs` adheres to security rules, and meticulously crafting both `security_spec.md` and `firestore.rules`. I\'m integrating the bootstrapped admin email for admin authorization checks. Furthermore, I\'ll update the `metadata.json` for proper integration.\n\n\n"
