  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Blueprint**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the initial Firebase blueprint. I\'m generating the `firebase-blueprint.json` file, along with the Phase 0 security specification, the `security_spec.md`, and a draft of the Firestore rules in `DRAFT_firestore.rules`. My aim is to strictly adhere to the Eight Pillars of Hardened Rules for maximum security. I\'m focusing on the Print collection for now.\n\n\n**Refining the Data Model**\n\nI\'ve significantly refined the data model. The new `firebase-blueprint.json` file now cleanly represents all collections and paths, matching the structure in my `DRAFT_firestore.rules`. I\'ve added a number of data model elements, including: `/users/{userId}`, `/admins/{adminId}`, `/users/{userId}/folders/{folderId}`, `/users/{userId}/documents/{documentId}`, `/users/{userId}/printPresets/{presetId}`, `/users/{userId}/savedShops/{savedShopId}`, `/shops/{shopId}`, `/shops/{shopId}/inventory/{itemId}`, and `/shops/{shopId}/printers/{printerId}`. I\'m ensuring all elements are accounted for to the best of my current knowledge.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "3b7-asbeHPynvdIPtfys6A8"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7172418485089647063"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"{\\n  \\\"entities\\\": {\\n    \\\"UserProfile\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"UserProfile\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Private user account profile and preferences. PII isolated to owner and admins.\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"displayName\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 100 },\\n        \\\"email\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"email\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 160 },\\n        \\\"phone\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 32 },\\n        \\\"role\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"customer\\\", \\\"shop_owner\\\", \\\"shop_employee\\\", \\\"admin\\\", \\\"support\\\"] },\\n        \\\"preferredLanguage\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 16 },\\n        \\\"theme\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"light\\\", \\\"dark\\\", \\\"system\\\"] },\\n        \\\"subscriptionPlan\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"free\\\", \\\"premium\\\"] },\\n        \\\"loyaltyPoints\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"storageUsedBytes\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"aiEnabled\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"boolean\\\" },\\n        \\\"cloudBackupEnabled\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"boolean\\\" },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" },\\n        \\\"updatedAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"uid\\\", \\\"displayName\\\", \\\"email\\\", \\\"role\\\", \\\"createdAt\\\", \\\"updatedAt\\\"]\\n    },\\n    \\\"Folder\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Folder\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\