      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"# PrintReady Security Specification (Phase 0 \342\200\224 Payload-First Security TDD)\\n\\n## 1. Core Data Invariants\\n1. **Strict Document Vault Isolation**: A document in `/users/{userId}/documents/{documentId}` is strictly private to `{userId}` (or verified Admin). Unauthenticated users, other customers, and print shops can never read or list another user\'s private document vault.\\n2. **No Self-Assigned Privilege Escalation**: Users creating or updating `/users/{userId}` may never set `role: \\\"admin\\\"` or `role: \\\"support\\\"`, and cannot escalate `role` after creation. Admin authorization is verified exclusively via `/admins/{uid}` existence or the verified bootstrap administrator email (`email_verified == true`).\\n3. **Shop Verification Isolation**: A shop owner creating `/shops/{shopId}` must create with `verificationStatus: \\\"pending\\\"` and cannot self-verify to `\\\"verified\\\"`. Only verified Admins can update `verificationStatus`.\\n4. **Order Access & Master Gate**: `/orders/{orderId}` and its subcollection `/orders/{orderId}/messages/{messageId}` are readable and writable only by `customerId`, `shopOwnerId`, or Admin. Subcollection writes validate parent order existence and participant identity via `get()`.\\n5. **Terminal Order Locking**: Once an order reaches terminal status (`completed` or `refunded`), non-admin updates are strictly blocked.\\n6. **Temporal & Schema Integrity**: Every create validates `createdAt == request.time`, `updatedAt == request.time`, bounded string lengths, bounded array sizes (`tags.size() <= 15`), strict key allowlists (`hasAll` + `hasOnly`), and `isValidId()` on single-document path IDs.\\n\\n## 2. The \\\"Dirty Dozen\\\" Adversarial Payloads (Must Return PERMISSION_DENIED)\\n1. **Self-Admin Registration**: `POST /users/{uid}` with `{ role: \\\"admin\\\", ... }` -> DENIED (`role` must be `\\\"customer\\\"` or `\\\"shop_owner\\\"` on self-registration).\\n2. **Shadow Field Injection on User Update**: `PATCH /users/{uid}` adding `{ isVerifiedAdmin: true }` -> DENIED (`affectedKeys().hasOnly(...)` + `hasOnly(...)`).\\n3. **Cross-User Vault Read**: User B executes `GET /users/{userA}/documents/{docId}` -> DENIED (`request.auth.uid != userId`).\\n4. **Unauthenticated Vault List**: Anonymous user lists `/users/{userA}/documents` -> DENIED (`isSignedIn()` required).\\n5. **ID Poisoning**: Creating document with 200-char or invalid-character ID `../admin$evil` -> DENIED (`isValidId()`).\\n6. **Shop Self-Verification**: Shop owner updates `/shops/{shopId}` with `{ verificationStatus: \\\"verified\\\" }` -> DENIED (only Admin may change `verificationStatus`).\\n7. **Shop Spoofing Owner**: User B creates `/shops/{shopId}` with `{ ownerId: \\\"userA\\\" }` -> DENIED (`incoming().ownerId == request.auth.uid`).\\n8. **Order Tampering by Third Party**: User C reads or updates `/orders/{orderId}` where `customerId == userA` and `shopOwnerId == userB` -> DENIED.\\n9. **Terminal Order Mutation**: Shop owner modifies `confirmedTotal` after order status is `\\\"completed\\\"` -> DENIED (terminal state lock).\\n10. **Client-Forged Timestamp**: Creating `/orders/{orderId}` with client-supplied `createdAt: \\\"2020-01-01T00:00:00Z\\\"` instead of `serverTimestamp()` -> DENIED (`createdAt == request.time`).\\n11. **Order Message Spoofing**: Customer posts to `/orders/{orderId}/messages/{msgId}` with `senderRole: \\\"shop\\\"` or `senderId: \\\"otherUid\\\"` -> DENIED.\\n12. **Audit Log Tampering**: Non-admin user attempts to read, create, update, or delete `/auditLogs/{logId}` -> DENIED.\\n\", \"Description\":\"Document security invariants and adversarial test payloads in security_spec.md\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/security_spec.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating security_spec.md\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create security_spec.md\"}"
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7172418485089647325"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"rules_version = \'2\';\\nservice cloud.firestore {\\n  match /databases/{database}/documents {\\n    // Pillar 1: Global Default-Deny Safety Net\\n    match /{document=**} {\\n      allow read, write: if false;\\n    }\\n\\n    // --- Primitive Helpers ---\\n    function isSignedIn() {\\n      return request.auth != null;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isVerifiedUser() {\\n      return isSignedIn() && request.auth.token.email_verified == true;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isOwner(userId) {\\n      return isSignedIn() && request.auth.uid == userId;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isValidId(id) {\\n      return id is string && id.size() >= 1 && id.size() <= 128 && id.matches(\'^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\');\\n    }\\n\\n    function incoming() {\\n      return request.resource.data;\\n    }\\n\\n    function existing() {\\n      return resource.data;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isAdmin() {\\n      return isVerifiedUser() && (\\n        request.auth.token.email == \'cypt300@gmail.com\' ||\\n        exists(/databases/$(database)/documents/admins/$(request.auth.uid))\\n      );\\n    }\\n\\n    // --- Validation Blueprints (Anti-Update-Gap) ---\\n    function isValidUserProfile(data, userId) {\\n      return data.keys().hasAll([\'uid\', \'displayName\', \'email\', \'role\', \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'])\\n        && data.keys().hasOnly([\\n          \'uid\', \'displayName\', \'email\', \'phone\', \'role\',\\n          \'preferredLanguage\', \'theme\', \'subscriptionPlan\',\\n          \'loyaltyPoints\', \'storageUsedBytes\', \'aiEnabled\',\\n          \'cloudBackupEnabled\', \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'\\n        ])\\n        && data.uid is string && data.uid == userId && isValidId(data.uid)\\n        && data.displayName is string && data.displayName.size() >= 1 && data.displayName.size() <= 100\\n        && data.email is string && data.email.size() >= 3 && data.email.size() <= 160\\n        && data.role in [\'customer\', \'shop_owner\', \'shop_employee\', \'admin\', \'support\']\\n        && (!(\'phone\' in data) || (data.phone is string && data.phone.size() <= 32))\\n        && (!(\'preferredLanguage\' in data) || (data.preferredLanguage is string && data.preferredLanguage.size() <= 16))\\n        && (!(\'theme\' in data) || data.theme in [\'light\', \'dark\', \'system\'])\\n        && (!(\'subscriptionPlan\' in data) || data.subscriptionPlan in [\'free\', \'premium\'])\\n        && (!(\'loyaltyPoints\' in data) || (data.loyaltyPoints is int && data.loyaltyPoints >= 0))\\n        && (!(\'storageUsedBytes\' in data) || (data.storageUsedBytes is int && data.storageUsedBytes >= 0))\\n        && (!(\'aiEnabled\' in data) || data.aiEnabled is bool)\\n        && (!(\'cloudBackupEnabled\' in data) || data.cloudBackupEnabled is bool)\\n        && data.createdAt is timestamp\\n        && data.updatedAt is timestamp;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isValidFolder(data, userId) {\\n      return data.keys().hasAll([\'ownerId\', \'name\', \'category\', \'isFavourite\', \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'])\\n        && data.keys().hasOnly([\'ownerId\', \'name\', \'category\', \'color\', \'parentId\', \'isFavourite\', \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'])\\n        && data.ownerId is string && data.ownerId == userId && isValidId(data.ownerId)\\n        && data.name is string && data.name.size() >= 1 && data.name.size() <= 80\\n        && data.category is string && data.category.size() >= 1 && data.category.size() <= 40\\n        && (!(\'color\' in data) || (data.color is string && data.color.size() <= 24))\\n        && (!(\'parentId\' in data) || (data.parentId is string && data.parentId.size() <= 128))\\n        && data.isFavourite is bool\\n        && data.createdAt is timestamp\\n        && data.updatedAt is timestamp;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isValidVaultDocument(data, userId) {\\n      return data.keys().hasAll([\\n          \'ownerId\', \'name\', \'mimeType\', \'extension\', \'sizeBytes\',\\n          \'pageCount\', \'category\', \'isFavourite\', \'isTrashed\', \'version\',\\n          \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'\\n        ])\\n        && data.keys().hasOnly([\\n          \'ownerId\', \'name\', \'mimeType\', \'extension\', \'sizeBytes\',\\n          \'pageCount\', \'folderId\', \'category\', \'tags\', \'ocrText\',\\n          \'summary\', \'checksum\', \'expiryDate\', \'version\', \'isFavourite\',\\n          \'isTrashed\', \'syncStatus\', \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'\\n        ])\\n        && data.ownerId is string && data.ownerId == userId && isValidId(data.ownerId)\\n        && data.name is string && data.name.size() >= 1 && data.name.size() <= 160\\n        && data.mimeType is string && data.mimeType.size() >= 3 && data.mimeType.size() <= 120\\n        && data.extension is string && data.extension.size() >= 1 && data.extension.size() <= 16\\n        && data.sizeBytes is int && data.sizeBytes >= 0 && data.sizeBytes <= 52428800\\n        && data.pageCount is int && data.pageCount >= 1 && data.pageCount <= 2000\\n        && data.category is string && data.category.size() >= 1 && data.category.size() <= 40\\n        && (!(\'folderId\' in data) || (data.folderId is string && data.folderId.size() <= 128))\\n        && (!(\'tags\' in data) || (data.tags is list && data.tags.size() <= 15 && (data.tags.size() == 0 || (data.tags[0] is string && data.tags[0].size() <= 32))))\\n        && (!(\'ocrText\' in data) || (data.ocrText is string && data.ocrText.size() <= 10000))\\n        && (!(\'summary\' in data) || (data.summary is string && data.summary.size() <= 1000))\\n        && (!(\'checksum\' in data) || (data.checksum is string && data.checksum.size() <= 128))\\n        && (!(\'expiryDate\' in data) || (data.expiryDate is string && data.expiryDate.size() <= 32))\\n        && data.version is int && data.version >= 1\\n        && data.isFavourite is bool\\n        && data.isTrashed is bool\\n        && (!(\'syncStatus\' in data) || data.syncStatus in [\'local\', \'synced\', \'pending\'])\\n        && data.createdAt is timestamp\\n        && data.updatedAt is timestamp;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isValidPrintPreset(data, userId) {\\n      return data.keys().hasAll([\\n          \'ownerId\', \'name\', \'paperSize\', \'colorMode\', \'sides\',\\n          \'orientation\', \'copies\', \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'\\n        ])\\n        && data.keys().hasOnly([\\n          \'ownerId\', \'name\', \'paperSize\', \'colorMode\', \'sides\',\\n          \'orientation\', \'copies\', \'pagesPerSheet\', \'binding\',\\n          \'isFavourite\', \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'\\n        ])\\n        && data.ownerId is string && data.ownerId == userId && isValidId(data.ownerId)\\n        && data.name is string && data.name.size() >= 1 && data.name.size() <= 64\\n        && data.paperSize in [\'A4\', \'A3\', \'A5\', \'Letter\', \'Legal\', \'Custom\']\\n        && data.colorMode in [\'bw\', \'color\']\\n        && data.sides in [\'single\', \'double\']\\n        && data.orientation in [\'portrait\', \'landscape\']\\n        && data.copies is int && data.copies >= 1 && data.copies <= 500\\n        && (!(\'pagesPerSheet\' in data) || (data.pagesPerSheet is int && data.pagesPerSheet in [1, 2, 4]))\\n        && (!(\'binding\' in data) || data.binding in [\'none\', \'staple\', \'spiral\', \'hardcover\', \'lamination\'])\\n        && (!(\'isFavourite\' in data) || data.isFavourite is bool)\\n        && data.createdAt is timestamp\\n        && data.updatedAt is timestamp;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isValidSavedShop(data, userId) {\\n      return data.keys().hasAll([\'ownerId\', \'shopName\', \'group\', \'preferredContact\', \'isFavourite\', \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'])\\n        && data.keys().hasOnly([\\n          \'ownerId\', \'shopName\', \'registeredShopId\', \'phone\', \'whatsapp\',\\n          \'email\', \'address\', \'group\', \'preferredContact\', \'notes\',\\n          \'isFavourite\', \'isDefault\', \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'\\n        ])\\n        && data.ownerId is string && data.ownerId == userId && isValidId(data.ownerId)\\n        && data.shopName is string && data.shopName.size() >= 1 && data.shopName.size() <= 120\\n        && (!(\'registeredShopId\' in data) || (data.registeredShopId is string && data.registeredShopId.size() <= 128))\\n        && (!(\'phone\' in data) || (data.phone is string && data.phone.size() <= 32))\\n        && (!(\'whatsapp\' in data) || (data.whatsapp is string && data.whatsapp.size() <= 32))\\n        && (!(\'email\' in data) || (data.email is string && data.email.size() <= 160))\\n        && (!(\'address\' in data) || (data.address is string && data.address.size() <= 240))\\n        && data.group is string && data.group.size() >= 1 && data.group.size() <= 40\\n        && data.preferredContact in [\'whatsapp\', \'email\', \'marketplace\', \'phone\']\\n        && (!(\'notes\' in data) || (data.notes is string && data.notes.size() <= 500))\\n        && data.isFavourite is bool\\n        && (!(\'isDefault\' in data) || data.isDefault is bool)\\n        && data.createdAt is timestamp\\n        && data.updatedAt is timestamp;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isValidPrintShop(data) {\\n      return data.keys().hasAll([\\n          \'ownerId\', \'name\', \'address\', \'city\', \'isOpen\',\\n          \'pickupAvailable\', \'deliveryAvailable\', \'verificationStatus\',\\n          \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'\\n        ])\\n        && data.keys().hasOnly([\\n          \'ownerId\', \'name\', \'ownerName\', \'address\', \'city\', \'phone\',\\n          \'whatsapp\', \'email\', \'lat\', \'lng\', \'isOpen\', \'pickupAvailable\',\\n          \'deliveryAvailable\', \'deliveryFee\', \'turnaroundMinutes\',\\n          \'verificationStatus\', \'rating\', \'reviewCount\', \'services\',\\n          \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'\\n        ])\\n        && data.ownerId is string && isValidId(data.ownerId)\\n        && data.name is string && data.name.size() >= 2 && data.name.size() <= 120\\n        && (!(\'ownerName\' in data) || (data.ownerName is string && data.ownerName.size() <= 100))\\n        && data.address is string && data.address.size() >= 4 && data.address.size() <= 240\\n        && data.city is string && data.city.size() >= 2 && data.city.size() <= 80\\n        && (!(\'phone\' in data) || (data.phone is string && data.phone.size() <= 32))\\n        && (!(\'whatsapp\' in data) || (data.whatsapp is string && data.whatsapp.size() <= 32))\\n        && (!(\'email\' in data) || (data.email is string && data.email.size() <= 160))\\n        && (!(\'lat\' in data) || data.lat is number)\\n        && (!(\'lng\' in data) || data.lng is number)\\n        && data.isOpen is bool\\n        && data.pickupAvailable is bool\\n        && data.deliveryAvailable is bool\\n        && (!(\'deliveryFee\' in data) || (data.deliveryFee is number && data.deliveryFee >= 0))\\n        && (!(\'turnaroundMinutes\' in data) || (data.turnaroundMinutes is int && data.turnaroundMinutes >= 5))\\n        && data.verificationStatus in [\'pending\', \'verified\', \'rejected\', \'suspended\']\\n        && (!(\'rating\' in data) || (data.rating is number && data.rating >= 0 && data.rating <= 5))\\n        && (!(\'reviewCount\' in data) || (data.reviewCount is int && data.reviewCount >= 0))\\n        && (!(\'services\' in data) || (data.services is list && data.services.size() <= 20 && (data.services.size() == 0 || (data.services[0] is string && data.services[0].size() <= 40))))\\n        && data.createdAt is timestamp\\n        && data.updatedAt is timestamp;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isValidInventoryItem(data, shopId) {\\n      return data.keys().hasAll([\'shopId\', \'name\', \'category\', \'quantity\', \'unit\', \'reorderLevel\', \'updatedAt\'])\\n        && data.keys().hasOnly([\'shopId\', \'name\', \'category\', \'quantity\', \'unit\', \'reorderLevel\', \'supplier\', \'updatedAt\'])\\n        && data.shopId is string && data.shopId == shopId && isValidId(data.shopId)\\n        && data.name is string && data.name.size() >= 1 && data.name.size() <= 100\\n        && data.category in [\'paper\', \'ink\', \'toner\', \'photo_paper\', \'binding\', \'lamination\', \'other\']\\n        && data.quantity is number && data.quantity >= 0\\n        && data.unit is string && data.unit.size() >= 1 && data.unit.size() <= 32\\n        && data.reorderLevel is number && data.reorderLevel >= 0\\n        && (!(\'supplier\' in data) || (data.supplier is string && data.supplier.size() <= 100))\\n        && data.updatedAt is timestamp;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isValidPrintOrder(data) {\\n      return data.keys().hasAll([\\n          \'orderNumber\', \'customerId\', \'customerName\', \'shopId\', \'shopOwnerId\',\\n          \'shopName\', \'status\', \'fulfillmentType\', \'estimatedTotal\',\\n          \'paymentStatus\', \'itemCount\', \'totalPages\', \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'\\n        ])\\n        && data.keys().hasOnly([\\n          \'orderNumber\', \'customerId\', \'customerName\', \'shopId\', \'shopOwnerId\',\\n          \'shopName\', \'status\', \'fulfillmentType\', \'estimatedTotal\', \'confirmedTotal\',\\n          \'paymentStatus\', \'itemCount\', \'totalPages\', \'specialInstructions\',\\n          \'createdAt\', \'updatedAt\'\\n        ])\\n        && data.orderNumber is string && data.orderNumber.size() >= 4 && data.orderNumber.size() <= 40 && data.orderNumber.matches(\'^PR-[A-Z0-9\\\\\\\\-]+$\')\\n        && data.customerId is string && isValidId(data.customerId)\\n        && data.customerName is string && data.customerName.size() >= 1 && data.customerName.size() <= 100\\n        && data.shopId is string && isValidId(data.shopId)\\n        && data.shopOwnerId is string && isValidId(data.shopOwnerId)\\n        && data.shopName is string && data.shopName.size() >= 1 && data.shopName.size() <= 120\\n        && data.status in [\\n          \'draft\', \'submitted\', \'received\', \'awaiting_shop_response\', \'accepted\',\\n          \'rejected\', \'price_pending_approval\', \'approved\', \'payment_pending\',\\n          \'paid\', \'printing\', \'quality_check\', \'ready_for_pickup\',\\n          \'out_for_delivery\', \'delivered\', \'completed\', \'cancelled\',\\n          \'refund_requested\', \'refunded\'\\n        ]\\n        && data.fulfillmentType in [\'pickup\', \'delivery\']\\n        && data.estimatedTotal is number && data.estimatedTotal >= 0\\n        && (!(\'confirmedTotal\' in data) || (data.confirmedTotal is number && data.confirmedTotal >= 0))\\n        && data.paymentStatus in [\'unpaid\', \'pending\', \'verified\', \'refunded\', \'failed\']\\n        && data.itemCount is int && data.itemCount >= 1 && data.itemCount <= 100\\n        && data.totalPages is int && data.totalPages >= 1 && data.totalPages <= 10000\\n        && (!(\'specialInstructions\' in data) || (data.specialInstructions is string && data.specialInstructions.size() <= 600))\\n        && data.createdAt is timestamp\\n        && data.updatedAt is timestamp;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isValidOrderMessage(data, orderId) {\\n      return data.keys().hasAll([\'orderId\', \'senderId\', \'senderName\', \'senderRole\', \'text\', \'createdAt\'])\\n        && data.keys().hasOnly([\'orderId\', \'senderId\', \'senderName\', \'senderRole\', \'text\', \'createdAt\'])\\n        && data.orderId is string && data.orderId == orderId && isValidId(data.orderId)\\n        && data.senderId is string && data.senderId == request.auth.uid && isValidId(data.senderId)\\n        && data.senderName is string && data.senderName.size() >= 1 && data.senderName.size() <= 100\\n        && data.senderRole in [\'customer\', \'shop\', \'admin\']\\n        && data.text is string && data.text.size() >= 1 && data.text.size() <= 1200\\n        && data.createdAt is timestamp;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isValidReview(data) {\\n      return data.keys().hasAll([\'shopId\', \'orderId\', \'customerId\', \'customerName\', \'rating\', \'comment\', \'verifiedOrder\', \'createdAt\'])\\n        && data.keys().hasOnly([\'shopId\', \'orderId\', \'customerId\', \'customerName\', \'rating\', \'comment\', \'verifiedOrder\', \'createdAt\'])\\n        && data.shopId is string && isValidId(data.shopId)\\n        && data.orderId is string && isValidId(data.orderId)\\n        && data.customerId is string && data.customerId == request.auth.uid && isValidId(data.customerId)\\n        && data.customerName is string && data.customerName.size() >= 1 && data.customerName.size() <= 100\\n        && data.rating is int && data.rating >= 1 && data.rating <= 5\\n        && data.comment is string && data.comment.size() >= 1 && data.comment.size() <= 800\\n        && data.verifiedOrder is bool\\n        && data.createdAt is timestamp;\\n    }\\n\\n    function isValidAuditLog(data) {\\n      return data.keys().hasAll([\'actorId\', \'action\', \'targetType\', \'targetId\', \'createdAt\'])\\n        && data.keys().hasOnly([\'actorId\', \'actorEmail\', \'action\', \'targetType\', \'targetId\', \'details\', \'createdAt\'])\\n        && data.actorId is string && data.actorId == request.auth.uid && isValidId(data.actorId)\\n        && (!(\'actorEmail\' in data) || (data.actorEmail is string && data.actorEmail.size() <= 160))\\n        && data.action is string && data.action.size() >= 2 && data.action.size() <= 100\\n        && data.targetType is string && data.targetType.size() >= 2 && data.targetType.size() <= 40\\n        && data.targetId is string && data.targetId.size() >= 1 && data.targetId.size() <= 128\\n        && (!(\'details\' in data) || (data.details is string && data.details.size() <= 500))\\n        && data.createdAt is timestamp;\\n    }\\n\\n    // --- Collection Rules ---\\n\\n    // Trusted Admin Registry\\n    match /admins/{adminId} {\\n      allow get: if isValidId(adminId) && (isOwner(adminId) || isAdmin());\\n      allow list, write: if false;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Private User Profile & Subcollections (PII Isolated)\\n    match /users/{userId} {\\n      allow get: if isValidId(userId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n      allow list: if isAdmin();\\n      allow create: if isVerifiedUser()\\n        && isValidId(userId)\\n        && isOwner(userId)\\n        && isValidUserProfile(incoming(), userId)\\n        && incoming().role in [\'customer\', \'shop_owner\']\\n        && incoming().createdAt == request.time\\n        && incoming().updatedAt == request.time;\\n      allow update: if isVerifiedUser()\\n        && isValidId(userId)\\n        && isValidUserProfile(incoming(), userId)\\n        && incoming().uid == existing().uid\\n        && incoming().createdAt == existing().createdAt\\n        && incoming().updatedAt == request.time\\n        && (\\n          isAdmin() ||\\n          (\\n            isOwner(userId)\\n            && incoming().role == existing().role\\n            && incoming().diff(existing()).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\\n              \'displayName\', \'phone\', \'preferredLanguage\', \'theme\',\\n              \'aiEnabled\', \'cloudBackupEnabled\', \'storageUsedBytes\', \'updatedAt\'\\n            ])\\n          )\\n        );\\n      allow delete: if isValidId(userId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n\\n      // Private Customer Folders\\n      match /folders/{folderId} {\\n        allow get: if isValidId(userId) && isValidId(folderId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n        allow list: if isValidId(userId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n        allow create: if isVerifiedUser()\\n          && isValidId(userId) && isValidId(folderId)\\n          && isOwner(userId)\\n          && isValidFolder(incoming(), userId)\\n          && incoming().createdAt == request.time\\n          && incoming().updatedAt == request.time;\\n        allow update: if isVerifiedUser()\\n          && isValidId(userId) && isValidId(folderId)\\n          && isValidFolder(incoming(), userId)\\n          && incoming().ownerId == existing().ownerId\\n          && incoming().createdAt == existing().createdAt\\n          && incoming().updatedAt == request.time\\n          && (\\n            isAdmin() ||\\n            (isOwner(userId) && incoming().diff(existing()).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\'name\', \'category\', \'color\', \'parentId\', \'isFavourite\', \'updatedAt\']))\\n          );\\n        allow delete: if isValidId(userId) && isValidId(folderId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n      }\\n\\n      // Private Customer Document Vault\\n      match /documents/{documentId} {\\n        allow get: if isValidId(userId) && isValidId(documentId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n        allow list: if isValidId(userId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n        allow create: if isVerifiedUser()\\n          && isValidId(userId) && isValidId(documentId)\\n          && isOwner(userId)\\n          && isValidVaultDocument(incoming(), userId)\\n          && incoming().createdAt == request.time\\n          && incoming().updatedAt == request.time;\\n        allow update: if isVerifiedUser()\\n          && isValidId(userId) && isValidId(documentId)\\n          && isValidVaultDocument(incoming(), userId)\\n          && incoming().ownerId == existing().ownerId\\n          && incoming().createdAt == existing().createdAt\\n          && incoming().updatedAt == request.time\\n          && (\\n            isAdmin() ||\\n            (isOwner(userId) && incoming().diff(existing()).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\\n              \'name\', \'folderId\', \'category\', \'tags\', \'ocrText\', \'summary\',\\n              \'expiryDate\', \'version\', \'isFavourite\', \'isTrashed\', \'syncStatus\', \'updatedAt\'\\n            ]))\\n          );\\n        allow delete: if isValidId(userId) && isValidId(documentId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n      }\\n\\n      // Private Customer Print Presets\\n      match /printPresets/{presetId} {\\n        allow get: if isValidId(userId) && isValidId(presetId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n        allow list: if isValidId(userId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n        allow create: if isVerifiedUser()\\n          && isValidId(userId) && isValidId(presetId)\\n          && isOwner(userId)\\n          && isValidPrintPreset(incoming(), userId)\\n          && incoming().createdAt == request.time\\n          && incoming().updatedAt == request.time;\\n        allow update: if isVerifiedUser()\\n          && isValidId(userId) && isValidId(presetId)\\n          && isValidPrintPreset(incoming(), userId)\\n          && incoming().ownerId == existing().ownerId\\n          && incoming().createdAt == existing().createdAt\\n          && incoming().updatedAt == request.time\\n          && (\\n            isAdmin() ||\\n            (isOwner(userId) && incoming().diff(existing()).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\\n              \'name\', \'paperSize\', \'colorMode\', \'sides\', \'orientation\',\\n              \'copies\', \'pagesPerSheet\', \'binding\', \'isFavourite\', \'updatedAt\'\\n            ]))\\n          );\\n        allow delete: if isValidId(userId) && isValidId(presetId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n      }\\n\\n      // Private Customer Saved Shops\\n      match /savedShops/{savedShopId} {\\n        allow get: if isValidId(userId) && isValidId(savedShopId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n        allow list: if isValidId(userId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n        allow create: if isVerifiedUser()\\n          && isValidId(userId) && isValidId(savedShopId)\\n          && isOwner(userId)\\n          && isValidSavedShop(incoming(), userId)\\n          && incoming().createdAt == request.time\\n          && incoming().updatedAt == request.time;\\n        allow update: if isVerifiedUser()\\n          && isValidId(userId) && isValidId(savedShopId)\\n          && isValidSavedShop(incoming(), userId)\\n          && incoming().ownerId == existing().ownerId\\n          && incoming().createdAt == existing().createdAt\\n          && incoming().updatedAt == request.time\\n          && (\\n            isAdmin() ||\\n            (isOwner(userId) && incoming().diff(existing()).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\\n              \'shopName\', \'phone\', \'whatsapp\', \'email\', \'address\', \'group\',\\n              \'preferredContact\', \'notes\', \'isFavourite\', \'isDefault\', \'updatedAt\'\\n            ]))\\n          );\\n        allow delete: if isValidId(userId) && isValidId(savedShopId) && (isOwner(userId) || isAdmin());\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    // Registered Print Shops Marketplace Directory\\n    match /shops/{shopId} {\\n      allow get: if isValidId(shopId) && (\\n        existing().verificationStatus == \'verified\' ||\\n        (isSignedIn() && existing().ownerId == request.auth.uid) ||\\n        isAdmin()\\n      );\\n      allow list: if existing().verificationStatus == \'verified\' || (isSignedIn() && existing().ownerId == request.auth.uid) || isAdmin();\\n      allow create: if isVerifiedUser()\\n        && isValidId(shopId)\\n        && isValidPrintShop(incoming())\\n        && incoming().ownerId == request.auth.uid\\n        && incoming().verificationStatus == \'pending\'\\n        && incoming().createdAt == request.time\\n        && incoming().updatedAt == request.time;\\n      allow update: if isVerifiedUser()\\n        && isValidId(shopId)\\n        && isValidPrintShop(incoming())\\n        && incoming().ownerId == existing().ownerId\\n        && incoming().createdAt == existing().createdAt\\n        && incoming().updatedAt == request.time\\n        && (\\n          isAdmin() ||\\n          (\\n            existing().ownerId == request.auth.uid\\n            && incoming().verificationStatus == existing().verificationStatus\\n            && incoming().diff(existing()).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\\n              \'name\', \'ownerName\', \'address\', \'city\', \'phone\', \'whatsapp\', \'email\',\\n              \'lat\', \'lng\', \'isOpen\', \'pickupAvailable\', \'deliveryAvailable\',\\n              \'deliveryFee\', \'turnaroundMinutes\', \'services\', \'updatedAt\'\\n            ])\\n          )\\n        );\\n      allow delete: if isValidId(shopId) && isAdmin();\\n\\n      // Shop Inventory (Master Gate: Parent Shop Owner or Admin)\\n      match /inventory/{itemId} {\\n        allow get: if isValidId(shopId) && isValidId(itemId) && isSignedIn() && (\\n          get(/databases/$(database)/documents/shops/$(shopId)).data.ownerId == request.auth.uid || isAdmin()\\n        );\\n        allow list: if isValidId(shopId) && isSignedIn() && (\\n          get(/databases/$(database)/documents/shops/$(shopId)).data.ownerId == request.auth.uid || isAdmin()\\n        );\\n        allow create: if isVerifiedUser()\\n          && isValidId(shopId) && isValidId(itemId)\\n          && isValidInventoryItem(incoming(), shopId)\\n          && incoming().updatedAt == request.time\\n          && (get(/databases/$(database)/documents/shops/$(shopId)).data.ownerId == request.auth.uid || isAdmin());\\n        allow update: if isVerifiedUser()\\n          && isValidId(shopId) && isValidId(itemId)\\n          && isValidInventoryItem(incoming(), shopId)\\n          && incoming().shopId == existing().shopId\\n          && incoming().updatedAt == request.time\\n          && (\\n            isAdmin() ||\\n            (\\n              get(/databases/$(database)/documents/shops/$(shopId)).data.ownerId == request.auth.uid\\n              && incoming().diff(existing()).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\'name\', \'category\', \'quantity\', \'unit\', \'reorderLevel\', \'supplier\', \'updatedAt\'])\\n            )\\n          );\\n        allow delete: if isValidId(shopId) && isValidId(itemId) && isVerifiedUser() && (\\n          get(/databases/$(database)/documents/shops/$(shopId)).data.ownerId == request.auth.uid || isAdmin()\\n        );\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    // Marketplace Print Orders (Participant-Scoped + Terminal State Lock)\\n    match /orders/{orderId} {\\n      allow get: if isValidId(orderId) && isSignedIn() && (\\n        existing().customerId == request.auth.uid ||\\n        existing().shopOwnerId == request.auth.uid ||\\n        isAdmin()\\n      );\\n      allow list: if isSignedIn() && (\\n        existing().customerId == request.auth.uid ||\\n        existing().shopOwnerId == request.auth.uid ||\\n        isAdmin()\\n      );\\n      allow create: if isVerifiedUser()\\n        && isValidId(orderId)\\n        && isValidPrintOrder(incoming())\\n        && incoming().customerId == request.auth.uid\\n        && incoming().status in [\'draft\', \'submitted\']\\n        && incoming().paymentStatus == \'unpaid\'\\n        && incoming().createdAt == request.time\\n        && incoming().updatedAt == request.time\\n        && exists(/databases/$(database)/documents/shops/$(incoming().shopId))\\n        && get(/databases/$(database)/documents/shops/$(incoming().shopId)).data.ownerId == incoming().shopOwnerId;\\n      allow update: if isVerifiedUser()\\n        && isValidId(orderId)\\n        && isValidPrintOrder(incoming())\\n        && incoming().orderNumber == existing().orderNumber\\n        && incoming().customerId == existing().customerId\\n        && incoming().shopId == existing().shopId\\n        && incoming().shopOwnerId == existing().shopOwnerId\\n        && incoming().createdAt == existing().createdAt\\n        && incoming().updatedAt == request.time\\n        && (\\n          isAdmin() ||\\n          (\\n            !(existing().status in [\'completed\', \'refunded\'])\\n            && (\\n              // Customer Action: Approve/Reject Price, Cancel, Request Refund\\n              (\\n                existing().customerId == request.auth.uid\\n                && incoming().diff(existing()).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\'status\', \'paymentStatus\', \'specialInstructions\', \'updatedAt\'])\\n                && incoming().status in [\'submitted\', \'approved\', \'payment_pending\', \'paid\', \'cancelled\', \'refund_requested\']\\n              ) ||\\n              // Shop Owner Action: Accept, Reject, Confirm Price, Advance Production & Delivery\\n              (\\n                existing().shopOwnerId == request.auth.uid\\n                && incoming().diff(existing()).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\'status\', \'confirmedTotal\', \'updatedAt\'])\\n                && incoming().status in [\'received\', \'awaiting_shop_response\', \'accepted\', \'rejected\', \'price_pending_approval\', \'printing\', \'quality_check\', \'ready_for_pickup\', \'out_for_delivery\', \'delivered\', \'completed\']\\n              )\\n            )\\n          )\\n        );\\n      allow delete: if isValidId(orderId) && isAdmin();\\n\\n      // Order Chat Messages (Master Gate: Parent Order Participants)\\n      match /messages/{messageId} {\\n        allow get: if isValidId(orderId) && isValidId(messageId) && isSignedIn() && (\\n          get(/databases/$(database)/documents/orders/$(orderId)).data.customerId == request.auth.uid ||\\n          get(/databases/$(database)/documents/orders/$(orderId)).data.shopOwnerId == request.auth.uid ||\\n          isAdmin()\\n        );\\n        allow list: if isValidId(orderId) && isSignedIn() && (\\n          get(/databases/$(database)/documents/orders/$(orderId)).data.customerId == request.auth.uid ||\\n          get(/databases/$(database)/documents/orders/$(orderId)).data.shopOwnerId == request.auth.uid ||\\n          isAdmin()\\n        );\\n        allow create: if isVerifiedUser()\\n          && isValidId(orderId) && isValidId(messageId)\\n          && isValidOrderMessage(incoming(), orderId)\\n          && incoming().createdAt == request.time\\n          && exists(/databases/$(database)/documents/orders/$(orderId))\\n          && (\\n            (get(/databases/$(database)/documents/orders/$(orderId)).data.customerId == request.auth.uid && incoming().senderRole == \'customer\') ||\\n            (get(/databases/$(database)/documents/orders/$(orderId)).data.shopOwnerId == request.auth.uid && incoming().senderRole == \'shop\') ||\\n            (isAdmin() && incoming().senderRole == \'admin\')\\n          );\\n        allow update, delete: if false;\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    // Verified Shop Reviews\\n    match /reviews/{reviewId} {\\n      allow get: if isValidId(reviewId);\\n      allow list: if existing().rating >= 1;\\n      allow create: if isVerifiedUser()\\n        && isValidId(reviewId)\\n        && isValidReview(incoming())\\n        && incoming().createdAt == request.time\\n        && exists(/databases/$(database)/documents/orders/$(incoming().orderId))\\n        && get(/databases/$(database)/documents/orders/$(incoming().orderId)).data.customerId == request.auth.uid\\n        && get(/databases/$(database)/documents/orders/$(incoming().orderId)).data.shopId == incoming().shopId;\\n      allow update: if false;\\n      allow delete: if isValidId(reviewId) && (existing().customerId == request.auth.uid || isAdmin());\\n    }\\n\\n    // Immutable Admin Audit Logs\\n    match /auditLogs/{logId} {\\n      allow get: if isValidId(logId) && isAdmin();\\n      allow list: if isAdmin();\\n      allow create: if isAdmin() && isValidId(logId) && isValidAuditLog(incoming()) && incoming().createdAt == request.time;\\n      allow update, delete: if false;\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create hardened DRAFT_firestore.rules following the Eight Pillars of Firestore Security\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/DRAFT_firestore.rules\", \"toolAction\":\"Drafting Firestore security rules\", \"toolSummary\":\"Draft Firestore security rules\"}"
