  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **Goal**: Build **PrintReady** (\"Upload once. Print anywhere.\"), a complete, functional, full-stack document wallet, smart printing workspace, print shop marketplace, and business operations ecosystem across three integrated workspaces:\n  1. **Customer Portal**: Home dashboard, private Document Vault (multi-file upload, folders, custom categories, preview, search, AI classification/OCR/search, duplicate detection, favourites, trash/restore), Camera Scanner & PDF Utilities (multi-page capture/filters/export to PDF, merge, split, rotate, watermark, page numbering), Print Basket & Presets & Cost Calculator & Direct Sharing (WhatsApp, Email, Native Share, Message Templates), Shop Discovery (List + Interactive Map, filters, optional geolocation, Shop Profile) & Saved Shops (including unregistered local shops), Marketplace Orders (strict state machine, timeline, price approval, server-verified payment, pickup code, order chat, verified reviews), and Account/Security/Privacy/Subscriptions/Integration Status.\n  2. **Print Shop Portal**: Business Dashboard (real computed KPIs + Recharts chart, low-inventory alerts), Incoming Orders & Print Queue (accept/reject, confirm custom price, assign staff & printer, advance order lifecycle, quick-reply chat), Editable Pricing & Shop Profile, Inventory & Printers management, Staff & Customer Reviews, and Shop Registration/Onboarding.\n  3. **Admin Dashboard**: Platform Overview (real KPIs + Recharts chart), Shop Verification Queue (approve/reject/suspend with audit logs), Orders/Refunds & Support Tickets, Configurable Coupons & Review Moderation, and Platform Settings & Immutable Audit Logs.\n- **Documentation Deliverable**: Maintain project documentation and a feature status checklist (`README.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `FEATURE_CHECKLIST.md`, `API_DOCUMENTATION.md`) honestly distinguishing implemented features vs external credentials required (live Razorpay, SMTP email, WhatsApp Business Cloud API, native Flutter Android wrapper).\n- **Target Bootstrap Admin Email**: `cypt300@gmail.com` (from runtime metadata).\n- **Environment Constraints**: Full-stack Express (`server.ts`) + React 19 + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4 on port 3000. Firebase Auth & Cloud Firestore provisioned via AI Studio RPC. Gemini API (`@google/genai` server-side, `gemini-4-hydrogen`) on backend only. Ultra Mode active (mandatory unit tests + real browser verification via `playwright-cli` + critique/fix loop, max 2 verification rounds).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n#### Completed Infrastructure & Provisioning\n- **Skills Read**:\n  - `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/SKILL.md` + `references/firestore-rules-and-blueprint.md` + `references/error-handling-and-sdk.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md` + `references/3_saas_dashboard.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md`\n- **Firebase Provisioned & Deployed**:\n  - User accepted Firebase terms; verified via `fax.GetFirebaseTos` (`{\"accepted\":true}`).\n  - Provisioned via `fax.ProvisionFirebase` (`projectId: \"gen-lang-client-0205857570\"`, `firestoreDatabaseId: \"ai-studio-48ab5c64-948e-428f-a39c-995bc46198ad\"`), creating `/firebase-applet-config.json`.\n  - Created `/firebase-blueprint.json`, `/security_spec.md`, `/eslint.config.mjs`, and `/firestore.rules` (Eight Pillars compliant, Red Team audited).\n  - Linted `/firestore.rules` with `npx eslint firestore.rules` -> **exited 0 (zero errors/warnings)**.\n  - Deployed rules via `fax.DeployRules` -> **succeeded** (`{}`). Deleted temporary `/DRAFT_firestore.rules`.\n- **Dependencies Installed**: `firebase`, `pdf-lib`, `recharts`, `@google/genai@latest`, `eslint`, `@firebase/eslint-plugin-security-rules`.\n- **Generated Visual Assets** (exact paths for Shop Discovery cards/drawers):\n  - `/src/assets/images/shop_campus_press_1795079810571.jpg`\n  - `/src/assets/images/shop_metro_print_1795079813823.jpg`\n  - `/src/assets/images/shop_apex_reprographics_1795079841606.jpg`\n\n#### Completed Code Files\n- **Config & Styling**:\n  - `/metadata.json` \342\200\224 Named `PrintReady`, permissions `[\"camera\", \"geolocation\"]`, `MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API`.\n  - `/index.html` \342\200\224 Synced `<title>`, meta/og tags, Google Fonts (`Plus Jakarta Sans`, `DM Sans`, `JetBrains Mono`).\n  - `/src/index.css` \342\200\224 `@import \"tailwindcss\";` + `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));` + font theme vars & `tabular-nums`.\n  - `/package.json` \342\200\224 Scripts updated: `\"dev\": \"tsx server.ts\"`, `\"start\": \"node server.ts\"`, `\"lint:rules\"`, `\"test\"`.\n  - `/.env.example` \342\200\224 Documented Gemini, Razorpay, SMTP Email, and WhatsApp Cloud API vars.\n- **Pure Domain Logic & Passing Unit Tests**:\n  - `/src/domain/types.ts` \342\200\224 Full PrintReady TypeScript interfaces.\n  - `/src/domain/printCalculator.ts` \342\200\224 Page range parser/validator (`\"1-5, 8, 10-12\"`), sheets & duplex math, shop-specific pricing, coupon validation, warnings.\n  - `/src/domain/orderStateMachine.ts` \342\200\224 All 19 order statuses, role-enforced transition matrix, terminal state locking (`completed`/`refunded`), contextual actions.\n  - `/src/domain/fileValidation.ts` \342\200\224 Upload MIME/extension/size/security validation, duplicate detection, share template variable renderer, WhatsApp/Mailto URL builders.\n  - Unit tests: `/src/domain/printCalculator.test.ts`, `/src/domain/orderStateMachine.test.ts`, `/src/domain/fileValidation.test.ts` \342\200\224 Executed via `npx --yes tsx --test src/domain/*.test.ts` -> **9/9 tests passed (exit 0)**.\n- **Backend, Firebase, PDF & State**:\n  - `/server.ts` \342\200\224 Express server on port 3000 with rate limiting, Vite middleware (dev) / static `dist` (prod), `/api/integrations/status`, `/api/ai/classify`, `/api/ai/search`, `/api/ai/summarize` (using `@google/genai` `gemini-4-hydrogen` + `User-Agent: aistudio-build`), `/api/payments/initiate`, `/api/payments/verify` (HMAC-SHA256 + `timingSafeEqual` + idempotency), and `/api/payments/webhook`.\n  - `/src/firebase.ts` \342\200\224 Firebase init (`getFirestore(app, firebaseConfig.firestoreDatabaseId)`), `testFirestoreConnection()`, `OperationType`, `FirestoreErrorInfo`, `handleFirestoreError`.\n  - `/src/data/firestoreSync.ts` \342\200\224 Schema-bounded Firestore CRUD sync for profiles, folders, documents, presets, saved shops.\n  - `/src/data/seedData.ts` \342\200\224 Deterministic Demo Workspace seed dataset (user, folders, docs, presets, 4 registered shops including 1 pending verification, saved shops including 1 unregistered local shop, 2 orders, inventory, printers, staff, reviews, coupons, share templates, notifications, support tickets, audit logs).\n  - `/src/utils/pdfTools.ts` \342\200\224 Real client-side PDF engine via `pdf-lib` (`exportScansToPdf`, `mergePdfBuffers`, `processPdfUtility`, `createPrintableSamplePdf`, `triggerBlobDownload`).\n  - `/src/components/ErrorBoundary.tsx` & `/src/context/PrintReadyContext.tsx` \342\200\224 Unified reactive state across all 3 portals, Firebase Auth listener, offline detection, localStorage + Firestore persistence, theme toggle, toasts.\n- **All Portal UI Components Built**:\n  - `/src/components/LayoutShell.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/customer/CustomerHomeView.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/customer/DocumentVaultView.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/customer/ScannerPdfToolsView.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/customer/PrintBasketView.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/customer/ShopDiscoveryView.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/customer/CustomerOrdersView.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/customer/AccountSettingsView.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/shop/ShopPortalView.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/admin/AdminPortalView.tsx`\n\n#### Remaining / Not Yet Completed\n- `/src/App.tsx` is still the empty starter template \342\200\224 needs to be wired to `ErrorBoundary`, `PrintReadyProvider`, `LayoutShell`, and route between all views based on `portal` and `activeTab`.\n- Project documentation files (`README.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `FEATURE_CHECKLIST.md`, `API_DOCUMENTATION.md`) have not been written yet.\n- TypeScript build (`compile_applet` / `lint_applet`) has not been run yet.\n- Dev server has not been restarted since switching `package.json` `\"dev\"` to `tsx server.ts`.\n- Ultra Mode real browser verification (`playwright-cli`) and critique/fix pass have not been executed yet.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n- **Attached File**: `/public/assets/aistudio/Paste_November_19__2026_-_2_39PM_0c8677fb` contains the exact same master prompt text as the user message (no separate mockup/image).\n- **Firebase Auth Constraints**: `ProvisionFirebase` configures Google Login only (`signInWithPopup` preferred due to iframe allowlisting). Demo Workspace mode runs out of the box with deterministic seed data + localStorage persistence so all journeys work immediately, while signing in with Google activates live Cloud Firestore sync.\n- **Firestore Security Rule Compliance**: During Red Team Audit, `allow list` rules on subcollections (`inventory`, `messages`) were hardened to check `existing().shopOwnerId`/`existing().customerId` without `get()` calls (satisfying Pillar 8 cost optimization), while `get`/`create`/`update` enforce Master Gate parent checks. Customer order updates are blocked from forging `paymentStatus: \'verified\'`.\n- **Design System Rules Applied**: Tailwind v4 `@custom-variant dark` enabled; Plus Jakarta Sans + DM Sans + JetBrains Mono; zero-pill metadata (`\302\267` separators instead of badge pills); single-elevation hairline cards; no `//` headers, no pulsing status dots, no `border-l-4` callouts, no fake telemetry tickers.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **No build/runtime errors encountered yet** (compilation and browser verification are the immediate next steps).\n- **Security Rule Pre-emptive Fix**: On drafting `DRAFT_firestore.rules`, replaced `get()` inside `allow list` on `inventory` and `messages` subcollections with denormalized participant fields (`shopOwnerId`, `customerId`) + `isBootstrapAdmin()` in final `firestore.rules` to comply with Pillar 8 (no `get()` in `allow list`). Re-linted with ESLint (0 errors) and deployed cleanly.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- All domain tests pass (`9/9`).\n- All 10 UI modules, `PrintReadyContext`, `server.ts`, `firebase.ts`, and `firestoreSync.ts` are written and ready to be connected in `/src/App.tsx`.\n- No background shell tasks or open Playwright browsers are running.\n- Remember: `firebase-applet-config.json` exists in workspace root and is imported by `/src/firebase.ts` (`import firebaseConfig from \'../firebase-applet-config.json\'`). Check `tsconfig.json` has `\"resolveJsonModule\": true` if TypeScript complains on JSON import during `compile_applet`/`lint_applet`.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Wire `/src/App.tsx`**:\n   - Wrap app in `ErrorBoundary` -> `PrintReadyProvider` -> `LayoutShell`.\n   - Render the active view cleanly for `portal === \'customer\'` (`home`, `vault`, `scanner`, `basket`, `shops`, `orders`, `account`), `portal === \'shop\'` (`ShopPortalView`), and `portal === \'admin\'` (`AdminPortalView`).\n   - Also check `/tsconfig.json` and ensure `\"resolveJsonModule\": true` is set if needed for `firebase-applet-config.json`.\n2. **Create Project Documentation** (concise, accurate, honest):\n   - `/README.md` (overview, stack, running locally, environment setup, honest integration notes for Razorpay/Email/WhatsApp/Flutter roadmap).\n   - `/ARCHITECTURE.md` (layers, Firebase collections, security model, API endpoints).\n   - `/FEATURE_CHECKLIST.md` (structured checklist marking every feature as `Verified`, `Implemented`, or `Integration Layer / Requires Credentials`).\n3. **Compile & Fix Any TS/Build Errors**:\n   - Run `compile_applet` (and fix any TypeScript or bundling issues, e.g., `resolveJsonModule` or `pdf-lib` Uint8Array `BlobPart` typing if strict TS flags `new Blob([bytes])` \342\200\224 use `new Blob([bytes as BlobPart])` or `bytes.slice().buffer` if needed).\n4. **Restart Dev Server**:\n   - Call `restart_dev_server` so port 3000 runs `tsx server.ts` with all API routes and updated React bundle.\n5. **Ultra Mode Verification Round 1 (Real Browser via `playwright-cli`)**:\n   - Run unit tests again (`npx --yes tsx --test src/domain/*.test.ts`).\n   - Use `playwright-cli` (`trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`, headless chromium, `1440 900`, unique screenshot filenames in `.playwright-cli/r1-*.png`, snapshot-first DOM checks):\n     - **Desktop First Paint**: Capture `.playwright-cli/r1-desktop-home.png`, check `playwright-cli console` & `requests` (verify zero 500s, zero uncaught errors, zero broken images).\n     - **Journey 1 (Vault + Basket + Direct Share + Order Submit)**: Navigate to Document Vault -> create folder `\"Job Applications\"` -> verify folder appears -> delete & restore a doc -> navigate to Print Basket -> update copies / test invalid page range warning then valid range `\"1-2\"` -> open Direct Share modal -> close -> submit Marketplace Order.\n     - **Journey 2 (Shop Operations + Customer Payment + Completion)**: Switch workspace to `Shop` -> open `Orders & Queue` -> verify newly submitted order appears -> Accept & Confirm Price -> switch back to `Customer` -> `Orders & Chat` -> Approve Price & Pay (verify `/api/payments/initiate` & `/api/payments/verify` return 200 and order moves to `Paid` with transaction ID!) -> switch to `Shop` -> advance to `Printing` -> `Quality Check` -> `Ready for Pickup` -> `Completed` -> capture `.playwright-cli/r1-shop-dashboard.png` verifying revenue updated.\n     - **Journey 3 (Scanner/PDF Tools, Shop Discovery Map/List, Admin Verification & Dark Mode + Mobile)**: Visit `Scanner & PDF Tools` -> click `Add Sample Scan` -> `Save PDF to Vault` -> visit `Print Shops` (test Map View + capture `.playwright-cli/r1-shops.png`) -> switch to `Admin` -> `Shop Verification` -> approve `QuickCopy Koramangala Express` -> verify audit log recorded -> toggle Dark Mode -> resize to `390 844` and capture `.playwright-cli/r1-mobile.png`.\n6. **Critique & Fix Pass (Max 2 Rounds Total)**:\n   - Review all screenshots & snapshots honestly, list top defects (if any) in reasoning, apply surgical fixes, re-run unit tests, `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` (co-executed on final check), `restart_dev_server`, and verify fixed screens in Round 2 (with unique `.playwright-cli/r2-*.png` filenames).\n7. **Final Honest Summary**:\n   - Summarize what works end-to-end, what was verified (unit tests, journeys, viewports), what was fixed, and honestly note external credential/platform boundaries (live Razorpay keys, SMTP, WhatsApp Cloud API, native Flutter Android build). Include the required reminder encouraging the user to review and harden `firestore.rules` before sharing broadly.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **No Fake Claims**: Never claim live Razorpay capture, silent WhatsApp auto-sending, or unverified features work. Always distinguish Demo Workspace vs Google Cloud Sync, and Server HMAC Sandbox vs Live Razorpay.\n- **No `window.alert` / `window.open`**: Use in-app toasts and standard `<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">` links.\n- **No API Key UI**: Never build UI for entering `GEMINI_API_KEY`.\n- **Frontend Design Constitution**: Strictly preserve zero-pill metadata, clean typography (`Plus Jakarta Sans` + `DM Sans` + `JetBrains Mono`), 60-30-10 color balance, single-elevation cards, no `border-l-4`, no pulsing dots, and full light/dark surface pairing.\n- **Firebase Rules**: Always re-lint and redeploy via `fax.DeployRules` if `firestore.rules` is touched; humbly encourage the user to review rules in the final message.\n- **Final Verification Gate**: Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together on the final build check after the last edit, ensure `npx --yes tsx --test` passes after the last edit, and close all Playwright browser sessions.\n</summary>"
