    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8277733975719396765"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Enable resolveJsonModule in tsconfig.json for firebase-applet-config.json import\", \"EndLine\":16, \"Instruction\":\"Add resolveJsonModule: true to compilerOptions\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"    \\\"moduleDetection\\\": \\\"force\\\",\\n    \\\"resolveJsonModule\\\": true,\\n    \\\"allowJs\\\": true,\", \"StartLine\":12, \"TargetContent\":\"    \\\"moduleDetection\\\": \\\"force\\\",\\n    \\\"allowJs\\\": true,\", \"TargetFile\":\"/tsconfig.json\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating TypeScript configuration\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update tsconfig.json\"}"
      original_name: "replace_file_content"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8277733975719395382"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"# PrintReady \342\200\224 Upload once. Print anywhere.\\n\\nPrintReady is a full-stack document wallet, smart printing workspace, print shop marketplace, and business operations platform covering three integrated portals:\\n\\n1. **Customer Portal**: Private Document Vault, Camera Scanner & Client-Side PDF Utilities (`pdf-lib`), Print Basket & Presets & Real-Time Cost Calculator, Direct Sharing (WhatsApp, Email, Native Web Share, Reusable Templates), Print Shop Discovery (List + Interactive Map) & Saved Shops (including unregistered local shops), Marketplace Orders (strict 19-state lifecycle, price approval, server-verified payment, pickup codes, order chat, verified reviews), and Account & Integration Status.\\n2. **Print Shop Portal**: Business Dashboard (computed revenue & turnaround KPIs + Recharts trend chart, low-inventory alerts), Incoming Orders & Print Queue (accept/reject, custom pricing, staff/printer assignment, lifecycle progression, quick-reply chat), Editable Pricing & Shop Profile, Inventory & Printer Fleet Management, Staff & Reviews, and Shop Registration/Onboarding.\\n3. **Admin Console**: Platform Overview, Shop Verification Queue (approve/reject/suspend with immutable audit logs), Orders/Disputes & Support Tickets, Configurable Coupons & Review Moderation, and Platform Settings & Audit Logs.\\n\\n## Stack\\n\\n- **Frontend**: React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, Lucide Icons, Recharts, `pdf-lib`\\n- **Backend**: Express (`server.ts`) serving both API routes (`/api/*`) and the React SPA on port `3000`\\n- **Database & Auth**: Firebase Authentication (Google Sign-In) & Cloud Firestore with deployed security rules (`firestore.rules`) and schema blueprint (`firebase-blueprint.json`)\\n- **AI Layer**: Server-side `@google/genai` (`gemini-4-hydrogen`) via `/api/ai/*` endpoints for document classification, natural-language vault search, and document summarization\\n- **Testing**: Pure domain logic unit tests using `node:test` (`npm test`)\\n\\n## Running Locally\\n\\n```bash\\nnpm install\\nnpm test\\nnpm run dev\\n```\\n\\nThe application serves on `http://localhost:3000`.\\n\\n### Workspace Modes\\n- **Demo Workspace (Default)**: Launches immediately with deterministic seeded data persisted in `localStorage` so every Customer, Shop, and Admin workflow works out of the box.\\n- **Google Cloud Sync**: Click **Sign In with Google** in the sidebar to authenticate with Firebase Auth and synchronize user profiles, folders, documents, presets, and saved shops to Cloud Firestore.\\n\\n## Honest Integration Boundaries\\n\\n- **AI Endpoints (`/api/ai/*`)**: Live when `GEMINI_API_KEY` is configured on the server; falls back cleanly to deterministic local classification/search when unavailable.\\n- **Payments (`/api/payments/*`)**: Always verified server-side with HMAC-SHA256 signature verification (`crypto.timingSafeEqual`) and idempotency tracking. Runs in **Server-Verified Sandbox Mode** when `RAZORPAY_KEY_ID` and `RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET` are absent; switches to Razorpay credentials when configured in server environment variables.\\n- **Direct Sharing**: Opens official WhatsApp (`wa.me`) and `mailto:` handoffs or the browser\'s `navigator.share()` sheet with pre-filled print instructions. Silent server-side WhatsApp Business Cloud API delivery and SMTP transactional email require external credentials (`WHATSAPP_CLOUD_API_TOKEN`, `SMTP_HOST`, etc.) documented in `.env.example`.\\n- **Native Mobile Wrapper**: Delivered as a responsive web application (mobile drawer, touch-friendly controls, Web Camera API scanner). A native Flutter Android/iOS binary wrapper is outside this web runtime.\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create accurate README.md covering stack, running locally, workspace modes, and honest integration boundaries\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/README.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing README documentation\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write README.md\"}"
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8277733975719398095"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"# PrintReady Architecture\\n\\n## System Layers\\n\\n1. **Pure Domain Layer (`src/domain/`)**\\n   - `types.ts`: Shared TypeScript models for documents, folders, print specs, shops, orders, messages, inventory, printers, staff, reviews, coupons, support tickets, and audit logs.\\n   - `printCalculator.ts`: Page range parsing/validation (`\\\"1-5, 8, 10-12\\\"`), duplex sheet calculations, shop-specific pricing matrix evaluation, coupon validation, and non-blocking warnings.\\n   - `orderStateMachine.ts`: 19-state order lifecycle, role-enforced transition matrix (`customer`, `shop`, `admin`), terminal state locks (`completed`, `refunded`), and contextual next-action helpers.\\n   - `fileValidation.ts`: Upload MIME/extension/size checks, duplicate file signature detection, share message template interpolation, and WhatsApp/Email handoff URL builders.\\n   - Covered by automated unit tests (`src/domain/*.test.ts`).\\n\\n2. **Client-Side PDF Engine (`src/utils/pdfTools.ts`)**\\n   - Powered by `pdf-lib` running locally in the browser: multi-page scan export to PDF, multi-PDF merge, page extraction/split, rotation, diagonal watermark stamping, and footer page numbering.\\n\\n3. **State & Persistence Layer (`src/context/PrintReadyContext.tsx`, `src/firebase.ts`, `src/data/firestoreSync.ts`)**\\n   - Unified reactive state across Customer, Shop, and Admin portals with `localStorage` persistence in Demo Workspace mode and Cloud Firestore synchronization when authenticated with Google Sign-In.\\n   - Explicit Firestore collection blueprint in `firebase-blueprint.json` and deployed security rules in `firestore.rules`.\\n\\n4. **Backend API Server (`server.ts`)**\\n   - Express server on port `3000` with per-IP rate limiting, Vite dev middleware in development, and static `dist/` serving in production.\\n   - Never exposes secrets to the client; reads `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `RAZORPAY_KEY_ID`, `RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET`, SMTP, and WhatsApp environment variables strictly server-side.\\n\\n## Firestore Collections & Security Model\\n\\n- `/users/{uid}` and user subcollections (`folders`, `documents`, `presets`, `savedShops`): Owner-only read/write, schema-validated fields.\\n- `/shops/{shopId}` and subcollections (`inventory`, `printers`, `staff`): Publicly readable for verified shops; write access restricted to the owning `ownerId` or bootstrap admin (`cypt300@gmail.com`).\\n- `/orders/{orderId}` and `/orders/{orderId}/messages/{messageId}`: Accessible only to the order\'s `customerId`, `shopOwnerId`, or admin. Customers cannot forge `paymentStatus: \'verified\'`.\\n- `/reviews/{reviewId}`, `/coupons/{couponId}`, `/supportTickets/{ticketId}`, `/auditLogs/{logId}`: Role-scoped access with immutable audit logging.\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create ARCHITECTURE.md describing domain, PDF, state, backend, and Firestore security architecture\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/ARCHITECTURE.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing architecture documentation\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write ARCHITECTURE.md\"}"
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8277733975719396712"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"# PrintReady Feature Checklist\\n\\nStatus legend:\\n- **Implemented & Verified**: Working end-to-end in the running web application and backed by unit tests or interactive checks.\\n- **Integration Ready (Credentials Required)**: Server endpoint and status detection implemented; external third-party credentials required for live network dispatch.\\n\\n| Area | Feature | Status | Notes |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| **Customer Vault** | Multi-file upload, MIME/size validation, duplicate warning | Implemented & Verified | Client validation + binary/preview handling |\\n| **Customer Vault** | Folders, custom categories, favourites, trash & restore | Implemented & Verified | Persisted locally and synced to Firestore when signed in |\\n| **Customer Vault** | AI Document Classification, OCR Summary & Natural Search | Implemented & Verified | Server-side `/api/ai/*` via Gemini (`gemini-4-hydrogen`) with local fallback |\\n| **Scanner & PDF** | Camera Scanner + Sample Scan + Filter adjustments + PDF Export | Implemented & Verified | Web Camera API + Canvas filters + `pdf-lib` export to Vault |\\n| **Scanner & PDF** | Merge, Split/Extract, Rotate, Watermark, Page Numbers | Implemented & Verified | Real client-side `pdf-lib` processing with download & save-to-vault |\\n| **Print Basket** | Per-item print config, page range parser, presets, warnings | Implemented & Verified | Backed by `src/domain/printCalculator.test.ts` |\\n| **Print Basket** | Live shop-specific cost breakdown & coupon discounts | Implemented & Verified | Recalculates per selected shop pricing matrix |\\n| **Direct Sharing** | WhatsApp (`wa.me`), Email (`mailto:`), Web Share, Templates | Implemented & Verified | Supports unregistered local shops with formatted print specs |\\n| **Shop Discovery** | Search, service/price/rating filters, List + Interactive Map | Implemented & Verified | Optional browser geolocation sorting + Shop Profile drawer |\\n| **Orders & Chat** | 19-state lifecycle, price approval, pickup code, order chat, reviews | Implemented & Verified | Role-enforced transitions in `orderStateMachine.ts` |\\n| **Payments** | Server-verified payment initiation & HMAC-SHA256 verification | Implemented & Verified | Sandbox HMAC server verification active; live Razorpay requires `RAZORPAY_KEY_ID` + `RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET` |\\n| **Shop Portal** | Computed KPI dashboard, revenue chart, low-stock alerts | Implemented & Verified | Real order/inventory calculations + Recharts |\\n| **Shop Portal** | Incoming order queue, custom pricing, staff/printer assignment | Implemented & Verified | Shared live state with Customer Orders |\\n| **Shop Portal** | Editable pricing, shop profile, inventory, printers, staff, onboarding | Implemented & Verified | Updates reflect in Customer cost calculator and discovery |\\n| **Admin Console** | Platform KPIs, shop verification queue, audit logs | Implemented & Verified | Approve/reject/suspend updates marketplace visibility & logs |\\n| **Admin Console** | Order disputes/refunds, support tickets, coupons, review moderation | Implemented & Verified | Full state updates across portals |\\n| **External Channels** | Silent WhatsApp Business Cloud API & SMTP Email dispatch | Integration Ready (Credentials Required) | Documented in `.env.example` & surfaced in Account -> Integration Status |\\n| **Native Mobile** | Native Flutter Android/iOS binary wrapper | Out of Scope (Web Runtime) | Responsive web SPA with mobile navigation drawer provided |\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create honest FEATURE_CHECKLIST.md separating verified capabilities from credential-gated integrations\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/FEATURE_CHECKLIST.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing feature checklist\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write FEATURE_CHECKLIST.md\"}"
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8277733975719395329"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"# PrintReady Backend API Documentation\\n\\nAll API routes are served by `server.ts` on the same origin (`/api/*`) with JSON bodies and per-IP rate limiting.\\n\\n## Integration Health\\n\\n### `GET /api/integrations/status`\\nReturns non-sensitive configuration status for external services:\\n- `gemini`: boolean (`GEMINI_API_KEY` present)\\n- `razorpayMode`: `\'live\' | \'sandbox\'`\\n- `smtpEmail`: boolean (`SMTP_HOST` configured)\\n- `whatsappCloudApi`: boolean (`WHATSAPP_CLOUD_API_TOKEN` configured)\\n\\n## AI Document Intelligence (Server-Side Gemini)\\n\\n### `POST /api/ai/classify`\\nClassifies a document based on filename, MIME type, and extracted text excerpt.\\n- **Request**: `{ fileName: string, mimeType?: string, textSample?: string }`\\n- **Response**: `{ category, tags, suggestedFolder, summary, confidence, provider: \'gemini\' | \'heuristic\' }`\\n\\n### `POST /api/ai/search`\\nMatches a natural-language query against user document metadata/summaries.\\n- **Request**: `{ query: string, documents: Array<{ id, name, category, tags, aiSummary }> }`\\n- **Response**: `{ matchedIds: string[], explanation: string, provider: \'gemini\' | \'heuristic\' }`\\n\\n### `POST /api/ai/summarize`\\nProduces a concise print-readiness summary for a document excerpt.\\n- **Request**: `{ fileName: string, textSample?: string }`\\n- **Response**: `{ summary: string, keyDetails: string[], provider: \'gemini\' | \'heuristic\' }`\\n\\n## Server-Verified Payments\\n\\n### `POST /api/payments/initiate`\\nCreates a server-tracked payment intent for a marketplace order.\\n- **Request**: `{ orderId: string, amountInr: number, customerName?: string }`\\n- **Response**: `{ paymentOrderId, orderId, amountPaise, currency: \'INR\', mode: \'sandbox\' | \'live\', keyId, sandboxSignatureHint? }`\\n\\n### `POST /api/payments/verify`\\nVerifies payment completion using HMAC-SHA256 (`crypto.timingSafeEqual`) with idempotency protection.\\n- **Request**: `{ orderId: string, paymentOrderId: string, paymentId: string, signature: string }`\\n- **Response**: `{ verified: true, transactionId, verifiedAt, mode, idempotentReplay?: boolean }`\\n\\n### `POST /api/payments/webhook`\\nValidates incoming Razorpay webhook signatures (`x-razorpay-signature`) using `RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET`.\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create API_DOCUMENTATION.md detailing PrintReady server routes and payloads\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/API_DOCUMENTATION.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing API documentation\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write API_DOCUMENTATION.md\"}"
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 36
      nanos: 617053491
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
