  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Discovering The Bug!**\n\nWow, I\'m so glad we examined `r2-final-orders-paid.png`! I can\'t believe the state-machine bug we just uncovered by stepping through the payment flow! That toast in the image is a massive red flag.\n\n\n**Unraveling The State Machine**\n\nI\'ve made headway, pinpointing a critical state transition error. Specifically, an invalid transition from \"Price Pending Approval\" to \"Paid\" has been identified. This stemmed from a React closure bug in `CustomerOrdersView` and `PrintReadyContext`. It appears that simultaneous calls to `transitionOrderStatus` within the same tick led to the issue, using stale state data. However, `r2-final-vault.png` is flawless.\n\n\n"
