  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Skill Check**\n\nI\'m initiating the Skill Check for the Razorpay Standard Web Checkout integration, focusing on ultra-mode for relevant skills within the Express + Vite + React TypeScript codebase. This initial assessment will help gauge the necessary expertise needed for this new user request, and the specific skills to perform the checkout integration task.\n\n\n**Analyzing Skill Relevance**\n\nI\'ve clarified the skills needed for this task. I\'ll need `computer-use` to verify the checkout flow in the browser and `frontend-design` for minor UI integration. Other skills, like `firebase-integration-rpc`, seem less relevant unless Firestore interactions become necessary. I\'m focusing on key files such as `server.ts`, `index.html`, and `CustomerOrdersView.tsx` to understand the integration points. I\'m now reviewing `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md` to see if there are any specific guidelines.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "HM3-aqarIcWlmtkP25-D-Ak"
