  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Coordinating Parallel Updates**\n\nI\'m now coordinating updates to `/server.ts`, `/src/components/customer/CustomerOrdersView.tsx`, and `/API_DOCUMENTATION.md` in parallel. I need to make sure I am carefully importing `Razorpay` from `\'razorpay\'` and the required components correctly within `/server.ts`. This involves a thorough double-check before any actual edits are made to ensure a clean integration.\n\n\n**Implementing API Endpoints**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in implementing the `POST /api/create-order` endpoint. I\'ve focused on incorporating `validateRazorpayOrderAmount`, `getRazorpayClient()`, and error handling for Razorpay API calls, especially authentication issues (401 errors). The endpoint will validate the amount, check for Razorpay credentials, and create the order. I\'m taking care to report the correct `mode` based on the API key and returning a standardized response.\n\n\n**Defining Payment Verification**\n\nI\'m now focused on the `/api/verify-payment` endpoint. My process involves extracting payment details, validating the Razorpay signature using `verifyRazorpaySignature`, and handling potential signature mismatches with a 400 error. Successfully verified payments will be idempotently stored. I will also be removing the old sandbox payment routes, replacing them with the new endpoints, and updating the customer orders view with `userProfile` for the Razorpay prefill. I will also handle and display `paymentError` state within the modal.\n\n\n**Orchestrating UI Interactions**\n\nI\'m currently integrating the Razorpay payment flow within the \"Pay with Razorpay\" button click. I\'m focusing on calling `/api/create-order` with the correct parameters, handling the loading of `window.Razorpay`, and managing potential script loading failures. I\'m also ensuring error handling for both payment success and failure, and I\'ll display the appropriate error messages and toast notifications as needed.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "ic3-aoSOOoTUz7IP2bHo8Qw"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14613793666598248171"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Integrate Razorpay Standard Checkout backend endpoints (POST /api/create-order and POST /api/verify-payment) using the official razorpay SDK and env vars\", \"Instruction\":\"Import Razorpay SDK and server/razorpay helpers, update /api/integrations/status, and replace sandbox payment routes with /api/create-order and /api/verify-payment\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":8, \"ReplacementContent\":\"import express from \'express\';\\nimport Razorpay from \'razorpay\';\\nimport { GoogleGenAI, Type } from \'@google/genai\';\\nimport { validateRazorpayOrderAmount, verifyRazorpaySignature } from \'./server/razorpay.ts\';\", \"StartLine\":5, \"TargetContent\":\"import express from \'express\';\\nimport { GoogleGenAI, Type } from \'@google/genai\';\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":67, \"ReplacementContent\":\"// Server-side verified Razorpay payment registry (idempotency & audit tracking)\\ninterface VerifiedRazorpayRecord {\\n  razorpay_order_id: string;\\n  razorpay_payment_id: string;\\n  verifiedAt: string;\\n  mode: \'razorpay_test\' | \'razorpay_live\';\\n}\\nconst verifiedRazorpayPayments = new Map<string, VerifiedRazorpayRecord>();\\n\\nfunction getRazorpayClient(): { client: Razorpay; keyId: string; keySecret: string } {\\n  const keyId = process.env.RAZORPAY_KEY_ID?.trim() || \'\';\\n  const keySecret = process.env.RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET?.trim() || \'\';\\n  if (!keyId || !keySecret) {\\n    const err = new Error(\'Razorpay credentials are not configured on the server.\');\\n    (err as Error & { statusCode?: number }).statusCode = 401;\\n    throw err;\\n  }\\n  return {\\n    client: new Razorpay({ key_id: keyId, key_secret: keySecret }),\\n    keyId,\\n    keySecret,\\n  };\\n}\", \"StartLine\":43, \"TargetContent\":\"// Server-side idempotency & sandbox payment intent registry\\ninterface PaymentRecord {\\n  intentId: string;\\n  orderId: string;\\n  orderNumber: string;\\n  amount: number;\\n  currency: string;\\n  method: string;\\n  mode: \'razorpay_live\' | \'server_sandbox\';\\n  status: \'initiated\' | \'verified\' | \'refunded\';\\n  transactionId?: string;\\n  serverSignature: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  verifiedAt?: string;\\n}\\nconst paymentStore = new Map<string, PaymentRecord>();\\nconst PAYMENT_HMAC_SECRET = process.env.RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET || \'printready-dev-sandbox-hmac-key\';\\n\\nfunction signPaymentPayload(intentId: string, orderId: string, amount: number): string {\\n  return crypto\\n    .createHmac(\'sha256\', PAYMENT_HMAC_SECRET)\\n    .update(`${intentId}|${orderId}|${amount.toFixed(2)}`)\\n    .digest(\'hex\');\\n}\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":92, \"ReplacementContent\":\"    const razorpayKeyId = process.env.RAZORPAY_KEY_ID?.trim() || \'\';\\n    const hasRazorpay = Boolean(razorpayKeyId && process.env.RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET?.trim());\\n    const isTestRazorpay = razorpayKeyId.startsWith(\'rzp_test_\');\\n    const hasEmail = Boolean(process.env.EMAIL_SMTP_HOST && process.env.EMAIL_SMTP_USER);\\n    const hasWhatsAppCloud = Boolean(process.env.WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN && process.env.WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID);\\n\\n    res.json({\\n      geminiAi: { configured: hasGemini, model: \'gemini-4-hydrogen\' },\\n      firebase: { configured: true, mode: \'client_sdk_firestore\' },\\n      payments: {\\n        provider: \'razorpay\',\\n        liveConfigured: hasRazorpay,\\n        mode: !hasRazorpay ? \'unconfigured\' : isTestRazorpay ? \'razorpay_test\' : \'razorpay_live\',\\n        note: !hasRazorpay\\n          ? \'Configure RAZORPAY_KEY_ID & RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET in .env to enable Razorpay Standard Checkout.\'\\n          : isTestRazorpay\\n          ? \'Razorpay Standard Checkout active in Test Mode (rzp_test_*).\'\\n          : \'Razorpay Standard Checkout active in Live Mode.\',\\n      },\", \"StartLine\":76, \"TargetContent\":\"    const hasRazorpay = Boolean(process.env.RAZORPAY_KEY_ID && process.env.RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET);\\n    const hasEmail = Boolean(process.env.EMAIL_SMTP_HOST && process.env.EMAIL_SMTP_USER);\\n    const hasWhatsAppCloud = Boolean(process.env.WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN && process.env.WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID);\\n\\n    res.json({\\n      geminiAi: { configured: hasGemini, model: \'gemini-4-hydrogen\' },\\n      firebase: { configured: true, mode: \'client_sdk_firestore\' },\\n      payments: {\\n        provider: \'razorpay\',\\n        liveConfigured: hasRazorpay,\\n        mode: hasRazorpay ? \'razorpay_live\' : \'server_sandbox\',\\n        note: hasRazorpay\\n          ? \'Live Razorpay merchant keys active.\'\\n          : \'Server-verified HMAC sandbox active. Configure RAZORPAY_KEY_ID & RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET for live settlements.\',\\n      },\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":432, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  // 5. Razorpay Standard Checkout \342\200\224 Step 1: Create Order\\n  app.post(\'/api/create-order\', async (req, res) => {\\n    const { amount, currency = \'INR\', receipt, notes } = req.body as {\\n      amount?: number;\\n      currency?: string;\\n      receipt?: string;\\n      notes?: Record<string, string>;\\n    };\\n\\n    const validation = validateRazorpayOrderAmount(amount);\\n    if (!validation.valid || !validation.amountPaise) {\\n      return res.status(400).json({ error: validation.error || \'Amount must be at least 100 paise.\' });\\n    }\\n\\n    let razorpayClient: Razorpay;\\n    let keyId: string;\\n    try {\\n      const ctx = getRazorpayClient();\\n      razorpayClient = ctx.client;\\n      keyId = ctx.keyId;\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      return res.status(401).json({\\n        error: err instanceof Error ? err.message : \'Razorpay authentication credentials missing.\',\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    try {\\n      const safeReceipt = String(receipt || `pr_${Date.now()}`).slice(0, 40);\\n      const order = await razorpayClient.orders.create({\\n        amount: validation.amountPaise,\\n        currency: String(currency || \'INR\').toUpperCase(),\\n        receipt: safeReceipt,\\n        notes: notes || {},\\n      });\\n\\n      return res.json({\\n        order_id: order.id,\\n        amount: order.amount,\\n        currency: order.currency,\\n        receipt: order.receipt,\\n        key_id: keyId,\\n      });\\n    } catch (err: unknown) {\\n      const rzpErr = err as { statusCode?: number; error?: { description?: string; code?: string }; message?: string };\\n      const statusCode = rzpErr?.statusCode === 401 ? 401 : 500;\\n      const message =\\n        rzpErr?.error?.description ||\\n        rzpErr?.message ||\\n        \'Failed to create Razorpay order.\';\\n      console.error(\'[Razorpay Create Order Error]\', statusCode, message);\\n      return res.status(statusCode).json({ error: message });\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  // 6. Razorpay Standard Checkout \342\200\224 Step 3: Verify Payment Signature\\n  app.post(\'/api/verify-payment\', (req, res) => {\\n    const { razorpay_order_id, razorpay_payment_id, razorpay_signature } = req.body as {\\n      razorpay_order_id?: string;\\n      razorpay_payment_id?: string;\\n      razorpay_signature?: string;\\n    };\\n\\n    const keySecret = process.env.RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET?.trim() || \'\';\\n    const keyId = process.env.RAZORPAY_KEY_ID?.trim() || \'\';\\n    const verification = verifyRazorpaySignature({\\n      razorpay_order_id,\\n      razorpay_payment_id,\\n      razorpay_signature,\\n      keySecret,\\n    });\\n\\n    if (!verification.valid) {\\n      return res.status(verification.statusCode).json({\\n        verified: false,\\n        error: verification.error,\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    const existing = verifiedRazorpayPayments.get(razorpay_payment_id!);\\n    if (existing) {\\n      return res.json({\\n        verified: true,\\n        duplicatePrevented: true,\\n        razorpay_order_id: existing.razorpay_order_id,\\n        razorpay_payment_id: existing.razorpay_payment_id,\\n        transactionId: existing.razorpay_payment_id,\\n        verifiedAt: existing.verifiedAt,\\n        mode: existing.mode,\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    const record: VerifiedRazorpayRecord = {\\n      razorpay_order_id: razorpay_order_id!,\\n      razorpay_payment_id: razorpay_payment_id!,\\n      verifiedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\\n      mode: keyId.startsWith(\'rzp_test_\') ? \'razorpay_test\' : \'razorpay_live\',\\n    };\\n    verifiedRazorpayPayments.set(record.razorpay_payment_id, record);\\n\\n    return res.json({\\n      verified: true,\\n      razorpay_order_id: record.razorpay_order_id,\\n      razorpay_payment_id: record.razorpay_payment_id,\\n      transactionId: record.razorpay_payment_id,\\n      verifiedAt: record.verifiedAt,\\n      mode: record.mode,\\n    });\\n  });\", \"StartLine\":332, \"TargetContent\":\"  // 5. Secure Server-Side Payment Initiation & Verification Abstraction\\n  app.post(\'/api/payments/initiate\', (req, res) => {\\n    const { orderId, orderNumber, amount, currency, method, idempotencyKey } = req.body as {\\n      orderId?: string;\\n      orderNumber?: string;\\n      amount?: number;\\n      currency?: string;\\n      method?: string;\\n      idempotencyKey?: string;\\n    };\\n\\n    if (!orderId || !orderNumber || typeof amount !== \'number\' || amount <= 0) {\\n      return res.status(400).json({ error: \'Valid orderId, orderNumber, and positive amount are required.\' });\\n    }\\n\\n    const existingKey = idempotencyKey && paymentStore.get(idempotencyKey);\\n    if (existingKey) {\\n      return res.json(existingKey);\\n    }\\n\\n    const hasLiveRazorpay = Boolean(process.env.RAZORPAY_KEY_ID && process.env.RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET);\\n    const intentId = `pay_int_${crypto.randomBytes(8).toString(\'hex\')}`;\\n    const serverSignature = signPaymentPayload(intentId, orderId, amount);\\n\\n    const record: PaymentRecord = {\\n      intentId,\\n      orderId,\\n      orderNumber,\\n      amount,\\n      currency: currency || \'INR\',\\n      method: method || \'UPI\',\\n      mode: hasLiveRazorpay ? \'razorpay_live\' : \'server_sandbox\',\\n      status: \'initiated\',\\n      serverSignature,\\n      createdAt: new Date().toISOString(),\\n    };\\n\\n    paymentStore.set(intentId, record);\\n    if (idempotencyKey) {\\n      paymentStore.set(idempotencyKey, record);\\n    }\\n\\n    return res.json({\\n      intentId: record.intentId,\\n      orderId: record.orderId,\\n      amount: record.amount,\\n      currency: record.currency,\\n      method: record.method,\\n      mode: record.mode,\\n      signatureToken: record.serverSignature,\\n      createdAt: record.createdAt,\\n    });\\n  });\\n\\n  app.post(\'/api/payments/verify\', (req, res) => {\\n    const { intentId, signatureToken } = req.body as {\\n      intentId?: string;\\n      signatureToken?: string;\\n    };\\n\\n    if (!intentId || !signatureToken) {\\n      return res.status(400).json({ error: \'intentId and signatureToken are required.\' });\\n    }\\n\\n    const record = paymentStore.get(intentId);\\n    if (!record) {\\n      return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Payment intent not found.\' });\\n    }\\n\\n    const expected = signPaymentPayload(record.intentId, record.orderId, record.amount);\\n    const sigBuf = Buffer.from(signatureToken);\\n    const expBuf = Buffer.from(expected);\\n    if (sigBuf.length !== expBuf.length || !crypto.timingSafeEqual(sigBuf, expBuf)) {\\n      return res.status(403).json({ error: \'Payment signature verification failed.\' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (record.status === \'verified\') {\\n      return res.json({\\n        verified: true,\\n        duplicatePrevented: true,\\n        transactionId: record.transactionId,\\n        verifiedAt: record.verifiedAt,\\n        mode: record.mode,\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    record.status = \'verified\';\\n    record.transactionId = `TXN-${Date.now().toString(36).toUpperCase()}-${crypto.randomBytes(3).toString(\'hex\').toUpperCase()}`;\\n    record.verifiedAt = new Date().toISOString();\\n\\n    return res.json({\\n      verified: true,\\n      transactionId: record.transactionId,\\n      verifiedAt: record.verifiedAt,\\n      mode: record.mode,\\n      amount: record.amount,\\n      currency: record.currency,\\n    });\\n  });\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/server.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Integrating Razorpay endpoints in server.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update server.ts with Razorpay APIs\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\360$\n\355$\001i\024}\023t\324\030yZ\252\332\365p/Y\307l,?8\265\205\254\0236\031\363\276y\021>\206\277p\323\232\371\024\344\263[\"\262{\354\316\247\301m$\352\312\327\274\327\035\241\305P\035\233#+\000\355\3670W\024Af\003\222)92Xu\"\211o!!\300\362]\235GP^\312\363\222\263\332\250\003>\221q\277\314H\025\331v\324~c\223\324K\342\006\373\320?\232x\036\036RA\306\362g]5\266\274C\225H\355\237\321\256\332\236\a\350\\\365\022\260\312\225\356\033\245V\335\331%u\267|\3172^\033=\345l\317i\225 \224\351\036x\207B\240\262Iz\230=85\322\v\b\035\273%|\024\342\331w\213\027\020\004\352R6>\312\\\035\333\332\000[\234\207\003\216\032Mp>S\303<\220\324?\271\177\206\276\227>N\'+\275\216\241\241\343\025\226\006/x\242f\334\000\362\177L\364\r\240\365hO\355\314w\325\261\a[\t~:J\243\b\312\371XW \024W\273r\301/m\326\343J\214\001]\243#\300j\2255>\374\257\276\335\365v\001bLd\356\020M\037\024]\032B\267\232\342t\345\370_I\2421\001\341/\363\035~\361\355\214@v\016\032[\026\237<\006+i\"\342\274\350\347<\352\350\230t#e\215\2555o\372\372C\351l\230\366\253\260\021\367\323$\326\313\361|\316\225\215S\335\236\263\265|\214a\271\364\320\203}#\212\304\321v\233\375\224\000\272\235/\374\002\344\255\202\264\254\320i\177\f\303\227\267^\3168\336u)\352\305\267\206\021\252\250[\245\251\205\241\232[\327\032\241\017lr\360\030n.\342\326=B\203\315\275\325\025\006\313Q\350YYs\251\030\306\307\203\344D\326S\250\260\003\f\336p#\203u\346\nh\216rg\347\"w\372\t\223f\026n@\357N\024\237\335\017R\204\337\332\353\312\263u\3478\301.\235\036\303\005\324\270\240\"]0\020\303\302\257\253\"v\355r\346\222YG\235\363<\370\337\v\354\006*\300\310t\024\227\355\031\261\247\'\262\242\345\345~\327N\260Eb\311\205\221\254C\270\016\227{%\367\371\034\261\371\210PV\303\366\235\321\r~4\366\201\343\322\005\032\356\346S\347\352\255\266\310_\f\v\346\253y7\301\264\205>m<\233\f\260\367\203\370Oq%3\211;\264qv\276\334\333\n\266\034mE\037\f\270\342J\221\2535\024f\256\027\2549,_\377\213\340L\302\023i\252\b0 \024\372\375\332\241aJ&v\23