  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Observing Razorpay Checkout**\n\nWow, I\'m thrilled! I just saw the Razorpay standard checkout modal open up in test mode! It\'s right there, `rzp-checkout-open.png`, and it displays all the right details: the test mode ribbon, the amount, the user, and that the transaction is secured by Razorpay. I can see the visual cues and confirm it\'s working as expected. This aligns with what I was hoping to see. I am also checking the backend status with the `GET /api/integrations/status` request.\n\n\n"
