  planner_response {
    response: "Here is where to get every credential and configuration detail used by **PrintReady**:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Razorpay Keys & Webhook Secret (Payments)\n1. Sign in to the [Razorpay Dashboard](https://dashboard.razorpay.com/).\n2. Toggle **Test Mode** (for sandbox testing) or **Live Mode** (after KYC approval for real payments) at the top of the dashboard.\n3. Go to **Account & Settings \342\206\222 API Keys** (under *Website and app settings*).\n4. Click **Generate Key** (or **Regenerate Key**):\n   - Copy **Key ID** (`rzp_test_...` or `rzp_live_...`) \342\206\222 set as both `RAZORPAY_KEY_ID` and `VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID`.\n   - Copy **Key Secret** (shown only once \342\200\224 download the key file) \342\206\222 set as `RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET` (**server-only**, never add `VITE_` to this).\n5. *(Optional)* For **Webhook Secret** (`RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET`):\n   - Go to **Account & Settings \342\206\222 Webhooks \342\206\222 + Add New Webhook**.\n   - Set the Webhook URL to `<YOUR_APP_URL>/api/payments/webhook`.\n   - Enter a strong **Secret**, select events (`payment.captured`, `payment.failed`, `order.paid`), and save. Copy that same secret into `RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET`.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Already Configured Automatically (No Action Needed)\n- **Gemini AI (`GEMINI_API_KEY`)**: Automatically injected from your AI Studio Secrets panel for document classification, AI search, and summarization.\n- **Firebase Auth & Cloud Firestore**: Already provisioned for this project (`firebase-applet-config.json` and deployed `firestore.rules`). Just click **Sign In with Google** in the sidebar to sync to the cloud.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Optional External Channel Credentials (If Needed Later)\nThese are optional \342\200\224 direct WhatsApp (`wa.me`) and Email (`mailto:`) sharing work out of the box without them.\n\n- **Automated Email Receipts (SMTP)** (`EMAIL_SMTP_HOST`, `EMAIL_SMTP_USER`, `EMAIL_SMTP_PASS`, `EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS`):\n  - Get SMTP credentials from providers like **Resend**, **SendGrid**, **Postmark**, **Brevo**, or a **Google Workspace / Gmail App Password** (`smtp.gmail.com`).\n- **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** (`WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN`, `WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID`):\n  1. Go to [Meta for Developers](https://developers.facebook.com/) \342\206\222 create a **Business** app \342\206\222 add the **WhatsApp** product.\n  2. Open **WhatsApp \342\206\222 API Setup** to copy your **Phone Number ID** and generate a permanent **System User Access Token** in Meta Business Settings.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Where to Put Them & Check Live Status\n- **Local / Dev**: Add values to `.env` (already ignored by `.gitignore`) or your hosting platform\'s environment variables / AI Studio Secrets panel.\n- **Check live connection status inside the app**: Open **Customer Portal \342\206\222 Account & Security** to view real-time status from `/api/integrations/status` (or inspect `README.md`, `API_DOCUMENTATION.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, and `FEATURE_CHECKLIST.md` in the workspace for full technical details).\n\nIf you meant inspecting **payment details** (like fetching a full Razorpay payment object \342\200\224 method, bank/UPI VPA, fee, status \342\200\224 after payment) or **order/user details** inside the app, let me know and I can wire that up for you."
    thinking: "**Clarifying User Intent**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the user\'s core need. It seems they want the complete picture - the \"all details\" - related to integrating the provided Razorpay information within the PrintReady app. That includes not just the initial credentials replacement, but understanding where/how to configure other settings, like the webhook secret, within the broader context of the system.\n\n\n**Outlining Required Credentials**\n\nI\'m now detailing all the required and optional credentials for the app. The focus is now on creating a concise step-by-step guide. First, I\'ll clarify how to find the Razorpay Keys and Webhook Secret within the Razorpay Dashboard, covering test and live modes. Next, I\'ll address optional integrations like Gemini and Firebase. Gemini\'s API key is readily available, and Firebase is already set up in the config.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "MdD-avCEBOS7qtsPvLur4Aw"
    modified_response: "Here is where to get every credential and configuration detail used by **PrintReady**:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Razorpay Keys & Webhook Secret (Payments)\n1. Sign in to the [Razorpay Dashboard](https://dashboard.razorpay.com/).\n2. Toggle **Test Mode** (for sandbox testing) or **Live Mode** (after KYC approval for real payments) at the top of the dashboard.\n3. Go to **Account & Settings \342\206\222 API Keys** (under *Website and app settings*).\n4. Click **Generate Key** (or **Regenerate Key**):\n   - Copy **Key ID** (`rzp_test_...` or `rzp_live_...`) \342\206\222 set as both `RAZORPAY_KEY_ID` and `VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID`.\n   - Copy **Key Secret** (shown only once \342\200\224 download the key file) \342\206\222 set as `RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET` (**server-only**, never add `VITE_` to this).\n5. *(Optional)* For **Webhook Secret** (`RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET`):\n   - Go to **Account & Settings \342\206\222 Webhooks \342\206\222 + Add New Webhook**.\n   - Set the Webhook URL to `<YOUR_APP_URL>/api/payments/webhook`.\n   - Enter a strong **Secret**, select events (`payment.captured`, `payment.failed`, `order.paid`), and save. Copy that same secret into `RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET`.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Already Configured Automatically (No Action Needed)\n- **Gemini AI (`GEMINI_API_KEY`)**: Automatically injected from your AI Studio Secrets panel for document classification, AI search, and summarization.\n- **Firebase Auth & Cloud Firestore**: Already provisioned for this project (`firebase-applet-config.json` and deployed `firestore.rules`). Just click **Sign In with Google** in the sidebar to sync to the cloud.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Optional External Channel Credentials (If Needed Later)\nThese are optional \342\200\224 direct WhatsApp (`wa.me`) and Email (`mailto:`) sharing work out of the box without them.\n\n- **Automated Email Receipts (SMTP)** (`EMAIL_SMTP_HOST`, `EMAIL_SMTP_USER`, `EMAIL_SMTP_PASS`, `EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS`):\n  - Get SMTP credentials from providers like **Resend**, **SendGrid**, **Postmark**, **Brevo**, or a **Google Workspace / Gmail App Password** (`smtp.gmail.com`).\n- **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** (`WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN`, `WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID`):\n  1. Go to [Meta for Developers](https://developers.facebook.com/) \342\206\222 create a **Business** app \342\206\222 add the **WhatsApp** product.\n  2. Open **WhatsApp \342\206\222 API Setup** to copy your **Phone Number ID** and generate a permanent **System User Access Token** in Meta Business Settings.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Where to Put Them & Check Live Status\n- **Local / Dev**: Add values to `.env` (already ignored by `.gitignore`) or your hosting platform\'s environment variables / AI Studio Secrets panel.\n- **Check live connection status inside the app**: Open **Customer Portal \342\206\222 Account & Security** to view real-time status from `/api/integrations/status` (or inspect `README.md`, `API_DOCUMENTATION.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, and `FEATURE_CHECKLIST.md` in the workspace for full technical details).\n\nIf you meant inspecting **payment details** (like fetching a full Razorpay payment object \342\200\224 method, bank/UPI VPA, fee, status \342\200\224 after payment) or **order/user details** inside the app, let me know and I can wire that up for you."
