  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Assessing UI Design Impact**\n\nI\'m considering how our UI design principles will be affected by these changes. Focusing on surgical edits to the customer-facing interface, I\'m thinking about maintaining UI quality and consistency. Removing payment, shop, and admin portals is top of mind, and ensuring a crisp experience with WhatsApp integration for the customer app is paramount. I\'m keen on preserving a clean UI.\n\n\n**Mapping Impact & Edits**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the code, meticulously mapping every file affected by the shift to a customer-only app with email and WhatsApp redirect options. The focus is removing payment and shop/admin code and ensuring a clean implementation of customer redirects. This includes a strict \"build, test, verify, critique, fix\" loop. I\'m taking a close look at the PWA aspects to preserve PWA integrity. I\'ll make clean edits.\n\n\n"
