    thinking: "**Executing Parallel Actions**\n\nI\'m focusing on making clean surgical edits to `PrintBasketView.tsx` and `src/data/seedData.ts` concurrently. My plan includes running the final verification gate, encompassing parallel execution of `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`, alongside unit tests and a restart of the dev server.\n\n\n"
